 "remarks": "This charming four bedroom Cape blends classic character with thoughtful updates. The main level features new hardwood floors, fresh interior paint and a beautifully renovated full bathroom. The kitchen is equipped with stainless steel appliances, including a Sub-Zero refrigerator and wine cooler. Upstairs, two generously sized bedrooms feature built-in drawers and closets offering ample storage, along with a second fully renovated bathroom completed in 2026. The finished lower level provides flexible bonus space, ideal for a family room, home gym, office or entertaining area. Additional improvements include a new water heater, upgraded 200-amp electrical service and grounded outlets throughout. Outdoor living is equally inviting. A low-maintenance Trex deck, added in 2025, overlooks the backyard, while a refreshed patio and sitting area beneath the deck provides an additional space to relax and entertain. Thoughtfully planted privacy trees create a more secluded setting. A new chimney flue and cap and a new storage shed add further value. Deeded beach rights complete this thoughtfully updated and exceptionally well-cared-for home.",
